$PROBLEM warfarin FOCE eval-only at the NONMEM MLE (6 sig. fig.), PRINT=E (#2974)
$INPUT ID TIME DV EVID AMT CMT=DROP RATE MDV
$DATA warfarin.csv IGNORE=@
$SUBROUTINES ADVAN2 TRANS2
$PK
  CL = THETA(1)*EXP(ETA(1))
  V  = THETA(2)*EXP(ETA(2))
  KA = THETA(3)*EXP(ETA(3))
  S2 = V
$ERROR
  IPRED = F
  Y = IPRED*(1 + THETA(4)*EPS(1))
$THETA (0.001, 0.132974, 10)  ; TVCL
$THETA (0.1, 7.73057, 500)    ; TVV
$THETA (0.01, 0.725261, 50)    ; TVKA
$THETA (0, 0.0107481)           ; PROP_ERR (SD)
$OMEGA 0.0285973 0.00957817 0.348907
$SIGMA 1 FIX
$ESTIMATION METHOD=1 MAXEVAL=0 NOABORT
$COVARIANCE PRINT=E
  
NM-TRAN MESSAGES 
  
 WARNINGS AND ERRORS (IF ANY) FOR PROBLEM    1
             
 (WARNING  2) NM-TRAN INFERS THAT THE DATA ARE POPULATION.
             
 (WARNING  111) $COVARIANCE: IN THE ABSENCE OF $ESTIM OR $MSFI, OR WITH
 $ESTIM MAXEVAL=0, THE UNCONDITIONAL OPTION IS REQUIRED. NM-TRAN HAS
